    "OT_VERSE_LINE": "Isaiah 40:28 — “The Creator of the ends of the earth, fainteth not, neither is weary.”",
    "NT_VERSE_LINE": "Romans 1:25 — “Who changed the truth of God into a lie, and worshipped and served the creature more than the Creator.”",
    "GREEK": "Κτίστης",
